The function should take just data as a parameter — data is your lineStatus array which has everything you need
You're using items.forEach but the array is called data
The container ID should be 'legend' not lineId
The list item needs to be appended to the list, and the list to the container at the end
You need to convert the hex colour from your lineColours object to a CSS colour string

