AI Disclaimer
This project was developed with the assistance of Claude.ai, an AI assistant made by Anthropic. Claude was used as a guided learning tool throughout the development process rather than as a code generator. Concepts including asynchronous JavaScript, the PixiJS rendering pipeline, coordinate projection, simplex noise and API data structuring were explained and worked through interactively. Code was written incrementally by the student with Claude providing guidance, corrections and explanations at each step. All creative decisions — including the visual concept, data sources, colour language and interaction design — were made by the student. Claude.ai was not used to generate complete solutions but to support understanding and problem solving throughout the build process.

